WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.040
Are you the “I'll pay, send me your share later” friend?

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.440
Scary Split is your new ally for splitting the bill.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:12.760
For us, a “sustito” is any party, trip or event where you need to share expenses.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.110
Sign in with your email or your Google account.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.450
Start by creating your sustito.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.040
Give it a name,

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.730
add your friends

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:22.870
and create it.

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:24.660
Once your sustito is ready,

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:27.000
add the first expense.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.720
Concept, amount, who paid and who takes part.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:34.270
Split it equally or set custom amounts.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.470
Share it with your friends,

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.050
they can add their expenses too.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.660
Every expense is saved to the list.

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:44.703
And at the end, we settle up.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.220
Scary Split simplifies the debts,

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.780
builds a balance

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.220
and shows you who owes whom.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:53.740
That means fewer transfers.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.700
Record payments as they happen,

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.380
confirm the amount

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.070
and the debts update.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:03.830
Payment by payment, until you're even.

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:05.750
Every payment is on record.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:08.830
And the sustito is settled.

00:01:08.950 --> 00:01:12.790
See which ones are still pending and which are all paid up.

00:01:12.967 --> 00:01:16.337
Don't let your sustito scare you. Create yours today.
